Description: System Settings for palOS
 One window for Wi-Fi and Network, Appearance (Dark Mode, text size, desktop
 background), Dock, Displays, Sound, Keyboard, Users, Date & Time and Power. Opened from
 Seeker's shield menu (System Settings...) and from the menu bar's Wi-Fi, sound
 and clock menus. Runs on Seeker's Electron runtime, so it adds no download.
